OL,3,GNEWSAFamily farms 'will be no more'
OL,4,Awithout tax U-turn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of family farms is under
OL,7,Fthreat if the government does not
OL,8,FU-turn on recent changes to inheritance
OL,9,Ftax, farmers have said.
OL,11,FSince April, inherited farming assets
OL,12,Fworth more than #2.5m face 20%
OL,13,Finheritance tax and dairy farmer Lynsey
OL,14,FAwde, from Melmerby, Cumbria, said her
OL,15,Ffamily had invested heavily in their
OL,16,Ffarm but that would not "be able to
OL,17,Fcarry on".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
