OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFamily farms 'will be no more'
OL,4,Awithout tax U-turn
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour MP for Penrith and Solway Markus
OL,7,FCampbell-Savours has joined calls on
OL,8,Fthe government to remove the cap on tax
OL,9,Frelief for farms ahead of Wednesday's
OL,10,FBudget.
OL,12,FThe government said it had listened to
OL,13,Ffarmers and protected small family
OL,14,Ffarms, while ensuring the largest
OL,15,Festates made a "fair contribution".
